    "identifier": "yoton-lava-release-ash-stone-seal",
    "description": "<p>You spew out a thick cloud of volcanic ash from yourself, which then wraps itself around a creatures of your choice within range, forcing them to make a Strength (or Charisma) saving throw, your choice. On a failure, the affected creature is Restrained and Molten for the duration. A creature restrained by this jutsu that is within a Molten Terrain automatically fails any saving throws made to resist the terrains effects.</p>\n<p>Affected creature remakes their saving throw to end this jutsu at the end of each of their turns.</p>",
